            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza i numeri da <code>1</code> a <code>5</code> impostando la condizione su <code>number &lt; 6</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(number)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" number += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>number</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;</code> e infine <code>6</code>.</p></body></html>"
